# Supabase project used by the global-best line on every game whose registry
# entry declares a leaderboard (see src/data/games.js).
# Copy to .env.local and fill in from Supabase: Project Settings -> API.
#
# These two names carry no VITE_ prefix, so Vite does not expose them by
# itself: vite.config.js injects exactly these two through `define`. Any other
# SUPABASE_* variable stays server-side, and the build refuses to run if a
# service-role or JWT secret is present in the same environment.
#
# The anon key is public by design — row-level security protects the table, and
# every write goes through a security-definer RPC (see README-supabase.sql).
#
# Both may be left empty: the games play normally and their leaderboards
# simply report as unavailable.
SUPABASE_URL=
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
